00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:30.000
Every Jew

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:31.000
and every Israeli.

00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:33.000
And,

00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:36.000
they are not Jews.

00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:37.000
Yes.

00:28:37.000 --> 00:28:38.000
They are not.

00:28:39.000 --> 00:28:40.000
There are other people.

00:28:43.000 --> 00:28:44.000
They are the Kibbutzim

00:28:44.000 --> 00:28:45.000
working for you.

00:28:46.000 --> 00:28:47.000
They are non-Jews.

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:48.000
They are all

00:28:49.000 --> 00:28:50.000
Shalom Akshar people.

00:28:50.000 --> 00:28:51.000
Yes, left wing.

00:28:51.000 --> 00:28:52.000
Socialist.

00:28:52.000 --> 00:28:53.000
Yes.

00:28:53.000 --> 00:28:54.000
To praise zeros

00:28:55.000 --> 00:28:57.000
and to hate them.

00:29:09.000 --> 00:29:10.000
Wrong work.

00:29:11.000 --> 00:29:12.000
I said.

00:29:14.000 --> 00:29:15.000
It didn't happen.

00:29:15.000 --> 00:29:16.000
It happened.

00:29:17.000 --> 00:29:18.000
Itガче.

00:29:19.000 --> 00:29:20.000
Not another one.

00:29:20.000 --> 00:29:21.000
Not another one,

00:29:21.000 --> 00:29:22.000
except 20s Popularites.

00:29:23.000 --> 00:29:27.000
That we work for others.

00:29:27.000 --> 00:29:29.000
We work, we do the work of others.

00:29:29.000 --> 00:29:30.000
Yes.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:32.000
We build things for the PLO.

00:29:32.000 --> 00:29:34.000
We give them money.

00:29:34.000 --> 00:29:36.000
Part of the money of the UGA.

00:29:36.000 --> 00:29:38.000
To have Arab schools.

00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:40.000
So on.

00:29:40.000 --> 00:29:42.000
The mistresses of,

00:29:42.000 --> 00:29:44.000
what's the name, of Harafat.

00:29:44.000 --> 00:29:45.000
We have to pay money for the mistress.

00:29:45.000 --> 00:29:47.000
Not only as a wife and so on.

00:29:47.000 --> 00:29:48.000
And then this.

00:29:48.000 --> 00:29:49.000
We have to do this.

00:29:49.000 --> 00:29:50.000
So therefore,

00:29:50.000 --> 00:29:52.000
We work for others, we do the work of others.

00:29:54.000 --> 00:30:01.000
And you shall serve Harafat.

00:30:05.000 --> 00:30:06.000
Now,

00:30:06.000 --> 00:30:08.000
