00:30:08.000 --> 00:30:12.000
Rabbi Ishmael and Rabbi Yohan.

00:30:12.000 --> 00:30:14.000
What's the other one?

00:30:14.000 --> 00:30:15.000
How do we make it?

00:30:15.000 --> 00:30:17.000
We make it Rabbi Ishmael,

00:30:17.000 --> 00:30:22.000
or we make it like Rabbi Yohan.

00:30:24.000 --> 00:30:27.000
Now we are going to be Makhriya in Harafat.

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:35.000
Now one second.

00:30:39.000 --> 00:30:42.000
Now I am going to give you a proof from history.

00:30:42.000 --> 00:30:43.000
Rabbi is going to be Makhriya.

00:30:43.000 --> 00:30:45.000
This is from the point of view of practice.

00:30:45.000 --> 00:30:48.000
Many people tried the way of Rabbi Ishmael.

00:30:53.000 --> 00:30:55.000
And they were successful.

00:30:58.000 --> 00:30:59.000
Continue.

00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:07.000
And many tried Rabbi Yohan to study only Torah.

00:31:08.000 --> 00:31:10.000
And they were not successful.

00:31:10.000 --> 00:31:12.000
Now what does it mean?

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:15.000
It means like this.

00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:20.000
That they were able to be successful in business,

00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:22.000
and successful in Torah.

00:31:22.000 --> 00:31:24.000
Whereas the other people,

00:31:24.000 --> 00:31:26.000
they were unsuccessful in business,

00:31:26.000 --> 00:31:28.000
and unsuccessful in Torah.

00:31:28.000 --> 00:31:30.000
They failed in both.

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:32.000
So here comes a very important thing.

00:31:32.000 --> 00:31:34.000
What's the Harafat?

00:31:34.000 --> 00:31:37.000
I am just telling you what happened in reality.

00:31:37.000 --> 00:31:38.000
Yes.

00:31:43.000 --> 00:31:45.000
They were neither great in Torah,

00:31:45.000 --> 00:31:47.000
nor great in business.

00:31:47.000 --> 00:31:48.000
And I was...

00:31:48.000 --> 00:31:49.000
They failed.

00:31:49.000 --> 00:31:50.000
Rabbi Yohan means they failed.

00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:52.000
In this, and they failed in that.

00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:59.000
And they were successful in both things.

00:31:59.000 --> 00:32:01.000
Choose whatever you want to do.

00:32:01.000 --> 00:32:03.000
But if you want to know,

00:32:03.000 --> 00:32:04.000
I am just going to tell you,

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:05.000
question of frequency.

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:07.000
Statistics.

00:32:07.000 --> 00:32:08.000
Statistics.

00:32:14.000 --> 00:32:15.000
Fine.

00:32:15.000 --> 00:32:16.000
Very good.

00:32:16.000 --> 00:32:17.000
Continue.

00:32:28.000 --> 00:32:29.000
Rabbi said to Rabbanan,

00:32:29.000 --> 00:32:31.000
