00:32:43.000 --> 00:32:45.000
And they were had...

00:32:45.000 --> 00:32:48.000
The whole Yeshiva had at least 70 faculty members.

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:51.000
I don't know.

00:32:51.000 --> 00:32:53.000
I presume

00:32:54.000 --> 00:32:56.000
