00:32:57.000 --> 00:32:58.000
Yes.

00:32:58.000 --> 00:33:00.000
That the Rabbanan were not paid.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.000
Yes.

00:33:01.000 --> 00:33:02.000
I am just presuming.

00:33:02.000 --> 00:33:03.000
So now,

00:33:03.000 --> 00:33:05.000
Rabbi said to Rabbanan,

00:33:05.000 --> 00:33:06.000
Be'matuta minayku.

00:33:08.000 --> 00:33:10.000
Be'matuta minayku means please.

00:33:10.000 --> 00:33:11.000
Shalom Aleichem.

00:33:14.000 --> 00:33:16.000
Be'matuta minayku means please.

00:33:16.000 --> 00:33:17.000
Yes?

00:33:17.000 --> 00:33:18.000
All right.

00:33:19.000 --> 00:33:20.000
Be'menisan...

00:33:20.000 --> 00:33:21.000
Go ahead.

00:33:25.000 --> 00:33:26.000
Yes.

00:33:26.000 --> 00:33:29.000
In the month of Tishrin.

00:33:29.000 --> 00:33:31.000
In the month of Nisan,

00:33:32.000 --> 00:33:35.000
do not appear before me.

00:33:35.000 --> 00:33:36.000
Do not come...

00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:37.000
Shalom Aleichem.

00:33:37.000 --> 00:33:40.000
Do not come to my Yeshiva.

00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:41.000
One second.

00:33:41.000 --> 00:33:42.000
Yes.

00:33:42.000 --> 00:33:44.000
Do not come to my Yeshiva.

00:33:44.000 --> 00:33:45.000
All right.

00:33:45.000 --> 00:33:46.000
Now,

00:33:46.000 --> 00:33:49.000
here this is a further confirmation of what?

00:33:49.000 --> 00:33:52.000
