00:33:52.000 --> 00:33:53.000
Namely that...

00:33:53.000 --> 00:33:54.000
That's enough.

00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:56.000
To do it like Rabbi Schmeier.

00:33:56.000 --> 00:33:57.000
Why?

00:33:58.000 --> 00:34:00.000
In the month of Nisan

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:02.000
